(https://github.com/ooni/minivpn), Copyright (c) the minivpn authors,
licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

Modifications in this repository add tls-auth support, P_DATA_V1/V2 receive
handling, AEAD framing fixes, push-request retries, full PUSH_REPLY parsing,
and public addressing helpers. They are distributed under the same license.

The OpenVPN protocol implementation follows the OpenVPN reference
implementation (https://github.com/OpenVPN/openvpn), which is GPL-2.0.
